cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this guest, cite meshoptimizer, whose remesher and simplifier it runs.
title: remesh.elf -- voxel remesh and simplify for avatar meshes (sandbox guest)
abstract: >-
  The remesh stage of RFD 2284. The host passes positions and indices; the
  guest returns a voxel-remeshed, welded and simplified mesh (positions
  only), or an attribute-aware simplification that indexes the original
  vertices so skin weights, UVs and blendshapes stay valid. The guest has no
  filesystem, sockets or host objects.
type: software
